\item date: ../../..\ \ \ \ \ author:
\end{enumerate}
\item[* task:] to substitute NPs for NPVARs inside a VARPREPP which is under a 
predrel/XP inside the VERBP (esp for predrel/ADJP)
\item[\ \ strategy:] (also: deviations from accepted proposals) the relevant 
relation names are copied from the ADJPsubgrammar (RadjSubstitution2). However, 
the locargrel has 
been removed, since it takes a PREPPVAR, not a VARPREPP; the forobjrel has not 
been removed, although at present (11-4-89) the English forobjmod-rule only 
makes PREPPs, and no VARPREPPs. Tempadvrel has been removed, since tempadvs 
are moved to the higher clause and are not inside the XP anymore.
\item[\ \ rejected alternatives:]
\item[\ \ clarification of variables:]
\item[\ \ clarification of the splitting up into subrules:]
\item[\ \ clarification of the collapsing of rules:] (e.g. clarification of parameters)
\item[\ \ differences analytical/generative version:]
\item[\  \ suggested semantics:]
\item[\ \ presuppositions:]\mbox{}
\begin{enumerate}
\item dictionary:\\

\item rules:\\

\end{enumerate}
